  "content": "<p>「Iris」的非官方分支，專為與FML相容而製作</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組需要Beddium模組，下載連結如下：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beddium</a></p><p>但目前尚未提供1.21.1版本的發布檔，不過這裡有封存版本。我已聯絡開發者，他表示會重新發布：<a href=\"https://github.com/peaksuperior885/Thorbedium/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/peaksuperior885/Thorbedium/releases</a></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforgeoculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/modrinth.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/peaksuperior885/ForgeOculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/github.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Uuxy92JNF3\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://api.tomas65107.dev/cdn/platformdecals/discord.png\" width=\"220\">\n  </a>\n</p>",
